#. type: Title =
#: modules/ROOT/pages/development/deployment/docker.adoc
#, no-wrap
msgid "Running in Docker"
msgstr "OpenEMS-Entwicklung: Betrieb in Docker"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/ROOT/pages/development/deployment/docker.adoc
msgid ""
"The first steps are described in xref:edge/deploy/docker.adoc[Deploy OpenEMS "
"Edge to Docker], xref:backend/deploy/docker.adoc[Deploy OpenEMS Backend to "
"Docker] and xref:ui/deploy/docker.adoc[Deploy the UI with Docker]. This page "
"adds what happens inside the images: structure, start sequence, ports, "
"volumes, environment variables, how to build and replace parts, and known "
"pitfalls."
msgstr ""
"Die ersten Schritte beschreiben xref:latest@edge/deploy/docker.adoc[Deploy "
"OpenEMS Edge to Docker], xref:latest@backend/deploy/docker.adoc[Deploy "
"OpenEMS Backend to Docker] und xref:latest@ui/deploy/docker.adoc[Deploy the "
"UI with Docker]. Diese Seite ergänzt, was in den Images passiert: Aufbau, "
"Startablauf, Ports, Volumes, Umgebungsvariablen, wie man Teile baut und "
"austauscht, und bekannte Stolperstellen."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/ROOT/pages/development/deployment/docker.adoc
msgid ""
"The statements are derived from the files under `+tools/docker/+` and the "
"Java code. Where something was tried out, it says so."
msgstr ""
"Die Aussagen sind aus den Dateien unter `+tools/docker/+` und dem Java-Code "
"abgeleitet. Wo etwas ausprobiert wurde, steht es dabei."

